{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_rope_set_1_story_2",
  "groupId": "story_rope_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "鮮花香水",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rope_1_2.txt",
  "sourceHash": "50f8e6a4d704b16c46c671a6847e8ce8bdf30ef57ac7437b52e2c967b39e60ff",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "真是太對不起了，剛剛因為在配製花卉需要的土壤，沒注意到有客人，一時反應過度......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "真的好丟人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "啊，沒事沒事，別在意，也是我不該擅自進來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "沒有這回事，羅德島的大家本來就可以隨意出入，沒有關係的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "不過，暗索小姐也真是，來了的話就直接喊我一聲嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哎，我可就差喊破喉嚨了，你完全沒反應呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "算了，總之沒什麼危險就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "危險？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "沒什麼沒什麼，別在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯......總之，謝謝關心~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "不過，在療養庭院是不會有危險的哦，畢竟這裡是讓客人們可以完全安下心來的地方，安全是有保障的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "也是，艙室外面還有那麼多層保護系統，不是我們內部的人完全進不來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "沒錯~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "說到這個，暗索小姐是什麼時候進門的？奇怪，門前應該裝了搖鈴才對呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "搖鈴？哦，你說的是門口那個只要碰到藏在地上的裝置，就會響的小鈴鐺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "對啦，就是那個，我一直把它當客鈴在用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "因為有的時候忙起來我會注意不到客人，所以可露希爾小姐就幫我安裝了那個搖鈴，只要門口的鈴響，我這邊工作間也會收到提醒哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嘿嘿~你說的是那個裝置的話，我直接跳過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "欸？跳......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗯哼，來路不明的裝置當然不能隨便亂踩！走路不出聲，爬牆不留痕，這可是生存必備技能呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "當初可露希爾小姐花了一個小時時間才把裝置藏好，還說絕對不會有人發現呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "暗索小姐真厲害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "好說好說，這方面我是專業的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "啊，等等，調香師小姐，臉上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "沾到泥了......哎，這裡，這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "啊，欸，臉上?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "這裡嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哎，算了，我來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "好了，擦掉啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "哇，謝謝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "（咦，這個味道的變化是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "啊，沒有，沒什麼，謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "（嗯......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "（一點點的話，應該沒問題吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "對了，暗索小姐，來找我有什麼事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "平常很少在這裡看到你呢，啊，莫非是暗索小姐開始對調香感興趣了？如果是那樣的話，我這裡隨時歡迎哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "不是，不是這麼回事啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "咦，那是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "是、是博士，對沒錯是博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "博士拜託我來取一些香薰，就要，呃，他平常常用的那種，幫助睡眠的那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "啊呀，博士又睡不著了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "算是吧？前兩天出任務的時候看起來精神就不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "而且還強撐著帶隊來支援......（小聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯？你剛剛說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "沒什麼！你聽錯啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯......是這樣嗎，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "要的是博士常用的，薰衣草香對吧？我知道啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "如果暗索小姐不趕時間的話，可以等我處理完這些培養土再替你取香薰嗎？現在手上全是泥，不太方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "暗索小姐可以先在溫室裡隨意轉轉，只要一點點時間就好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "當然沒問題~我就在這裡逛逛就好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "（攪拌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哎，這花長得還挺可愛的，小小的......咦咦咦怎麼突然長高了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "（攪拌）（攪拌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗚哇，嚇死人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "居然連一朵花都這麼危險，溫、溫室真是深不可測。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "（攪拌）（忍笑）（攪拌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗯？這個是......香料？嗚哇，好香的味道，嗯，嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哈、哈、哈——啾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "噗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "咳咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哈啾、哈啾、呃，唔呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "暗索小姐，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "我，我很好。哈啾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "不要勉強哦，那些花和香料都是我用來調香的材料，比起成品，可能味道不是那麼好，會更刺激一點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "何止是刺激了一點，哈、哈啾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "我的鼻子感覺都要廢掉了......居然每天面對這些，還能讓這些味道變得那麼好聞，我現在是真的開始敬佩你了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "這麼說就太誇張了。啊對了，暗索小姐，那邊的長桌上有一個綠色的小瓶子，如果鼻子不舒服的話，可以稍微聞一聞，應該會好很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哦——！感謝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "我看看，綠色的，綠色的......哈啾！有了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "啊，這個味道好好聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "你喜歡就好。有感覺好一點了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "真的不打噴嚏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "這玩意好靈啊！好厲害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "呵呵，暗索小姐以前是不是覺得，香薰沒什麼太大用處，只是心理作用，是奢侈的娛樂品？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "也、也沒有這麼想啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "不用緊張，我並不介意哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "大家最開始接觸調香和香薰的時候，多少都會有些誤會，畢竟是完全沒有瞭解的領域，暗索小姐會這麼想也很正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "怎樣讓大家真正了解調香，願意去了解調香，這就是我需要去努力的事情啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "唔，怎麼說呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "雖然我的確不太了解調香，但是我也知道調香師小姐的工作很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "畢竟博士還有那位凱爾希醫生都說好，那就錯不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "欸，博士和凱爾希醫生都......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "是哦，我有聽到他們說過好幾回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "“萊娜的香薰在先導治療和恢復領域很有優勢”......類似這樣的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "實際上也有不少幹員很愛往這裡跑吧？據說還有人會直接睡在溫室不想走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "是有一些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "因為這個，最近還特地多加了一些床位，但空間還是不太夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "再這麼下去的話，可能會需要向凱爾希醫生申請，將溫室再擴大一些了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "你看，這就對啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "這不是很棒嘛，已經有很多人明白調香的好了呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "雖然我搞不太清楚，但我不瞭解的東西太多啦，總不能因為自己不懂，就說這東西也沒用，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "......呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "欸，怎麼突然笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "調香師小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "呵呵，抱歉，嗯，就是有點高興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "暗索小姐不要在意。以及，如果不介意的話，可以直接叫我萊娜就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "咦，啊，這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "那麼我也直接叫小暗索了唷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "欸？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "可以當然是可以啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "呵呵，那就這麼定了"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（咦咦咦咦，怎麼回事啊？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "（調香師小姐是這麼自來熟的人嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗯，嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哎，調香師小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "呃，萊、萊娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯嗯。什麼事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......有沒有人說過，你意外地很強勢欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "沒有喲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "你騙人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "算了，也行吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "好啦，這樣培養土應該就完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "我去洗個手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "已經好了？唔，我好像看不出這土和之前有什麼區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "這個是用來培育花種的土壤，裡面的成分配比會比較特殊一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "花種？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "是哦。葛羅莉亞的治療到了一個新階段，需要用到一些很特殊的花卉，對於土壤的要求出乎意料地高呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "其實，之前幾次嘗試培育都不是很成功，這次是想試一試新的配比，看看是不是土壤的比例和營養出了問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哦哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "如果是營養的問題的話，倒是好辦，不過有些植物生長所需要的遠遠不止是營養，這就讓人比較頭痛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "希望這一次能夠成功。老實說，這次我還是挺有自信的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "聽起來怪複雜的，我還以為調香會更加，嗯，更加優雅的感覺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "就是那種，渾身香香的，又漂亮又高雅，好像從來沒做過活的大小姐才會做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "啊呀，小暗索這是在誇獎我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗯......這麼想也行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "謝謝~但是，我可不是什麼沒做過活的大小姐哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "這個嘛，從看到你臉上沾著泥巴的時候起我就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "哈哈，不要取笑我啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯，博士常用的香薰，我找找......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "我記得是放在這裡的，薰衣草，薰衣草......啊，有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "沒錯沒錯！就是這樣的小瓶子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "來，給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "這個很受歡迎，很多幹員都會選擇在睡前用一點，會更好入眠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哦~按我的經驗來看，包裝精美還效果非凡，這應該會是高價品吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "並不會很貴啦，這個是內部的非賣品，目前只有羅德島的大家用得到哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "對了，不如小暗索你也試試吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "欸？試什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "當然是香薰啦，像這樣經過稀釋的香薰精油，既便於攜帶，又有一定緩和情緒的作用，隨時隨地都可以使用，或許會成為新的潮流呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "暗索小姐這樣年輕漂亮的女性用起來最合適不過了！我給你推薦這種香型的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "停，停停停停！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "你拿這麼多瓶子出來幹什麼！？等、等下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "萊娜？？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "咦，小暗索，你為什麼要後退，還拿出鉤索？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "只是給你推薦一下而已，不會吃了你啦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "噫，我感覺到了危險......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "你想多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "真的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......我覺得我沒想多！！嗚哇！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "呼、呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "太好了，小暗索果然很適合香水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哪裡適合啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "身上留下氣味會很不妙的......在很多方面都，很不妙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "如果小暗索實在不願意的話，我當然不會勉強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "不過，真的很適合啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......啊啊啊我知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "我用！我用還不行嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "怎麼會搞成這樣的......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "好了好了，那，博士的香薰我就先拿走了哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "啊對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "差點就忘記了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "你還會隨身攜帶種子啊，收好不要再丟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "啊呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "居然現在就要還給我了嗎？比我想的要快呢，我還以為至少要再過兩天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "欸？等下，你在說什麼，等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "這個語氣，欸，難道萊娜你知道我拿了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "呵呵，我的鼻子可是很靈的哦，就算只是位置發生了一點點變化，也可以聞得出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......呃啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "對、對不起，我不是故意的！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "就是，那個，壞習慣犯了......嗚嗚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "哈哈，不用這樣，我並沒有怪你呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "嗯......實際上，我本來是打算再多準備一下的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "欸？準備？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "準備什麼？要報警嗎？是準備要報警來抓我嗎嗚嗚嗚嗚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "哇啊，小暗索？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "別激動，你別激動，不會報警的啦，不會有人來抓你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "真的真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚嗚萊娜你真是大好人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "哭了這麼久，一滴眼淚也沒擠出來呢，小暗索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "誒嘿。被發現啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "過去的事情就不提了吧！剛剛萊娜你說要準備，是要準備什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "啊，這個嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "小暗索你拿走的那個，是一枚花種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "花的，種子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "是哦，我本來打算替這枚種子準備一些合適的土壤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "這個花種很昂貴嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "並不會呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "那就是很稀有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "也不算少見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "雖然常見又平凡，但用心栽培的話，就會開出很好看的花，也很適合調香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "你看，不管是什麼樣的種子，最終都要回歸土壤，然後都能開出好看的花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "我本來打算，等到下次你來歸還種子的時候，就勸你親手將這枚種子種下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "讓我親手......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "沒錯哦，然後等到長出花兒，我就替你用這朵花做一款香薰吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "欸？為我？做香薰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "但是，為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "一定需要一個理由嗎？嗯......我想想哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "text": "可能是因為，我從之前就一直覺得，小暗索一定會很適合香薰吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "哼~哼哼~哼哼哼~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "晨露，薄荷，碎冰沙♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "喲，博士，還在處理戰鬥報告嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "上次任務多謝啦，我還以為這次真的要小命不保，沒想到博士你早有安排呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "text": "不過你就沒必要跟著支援小隊一起來了吧？也太危險了一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我需要確保幹員的安全。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "暗索",
          "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
          "text": "好啦，真的危急時刻我會抓著博士你一起跑啦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "暗索",
          "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
          "text": "啊，對了，這個給你，你用的香薰是這種沒錯吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "暗索",
          "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
          "text": "這個是，呃......是調香師、不對，是萊娜托我帶給你的！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你看起來很開心。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你好像有點不一樣了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "暗索",
          "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
          "text": "嘿嘿，看得出來？很明顯嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "暗索",
          "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
          "text": "因為有好事~"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "暗索",
          "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
          "text": "偷偷告訴你，我親手種的花，很快就要開花啦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
